<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-022" chapter-id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered" source-id="s-liangshu-022-current-rendered-hong-opening">
  <p id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0001" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AC">臨川靖惠王宏</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0002" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AC">宣達</persName>，<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0003" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_A">太祖</persName>第六子也。長八尺，美鬚眉，容止可觀。齊永明十年，爲衛軍<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0004" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">廬陵王</persName>法曹行參軍，遷太子舍人。時<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0005" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AD">長沙王懿</persName>鎮梁州，爲魏所圍，明年，給<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0006" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AC">宏</persName>精兵千人赴援，未至，魏軍退。遷驃騎<rs id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0007" type="unresolved">晉安王</rs>主簿，尋爲北中郎<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0008" ref="63c_vmw_dyi">桂陽王</persName>功曹史。<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0009" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AE">衡陽王暢</persName>，有美名，爲<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0010" ref="z5d_9zy_u5h_AA">始安王蕭遙光</persName>所禮。及<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0011" ref="z5d_9zy_u5h_AA">遙光</persName>作亂，逼<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0012" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AE">暢</persName>入東府，<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0013" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AE">暢</persName>懼禍，先赴臺。<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0014" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AA">高祖</persName>在雍州，常懼諸弟及禍，謂<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0015" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AF">南平王偉</persName>曰：「六弟明於事理，必先還臺。」及信至，果如<persName id="c-liangshu-022-hong-opening-rendered:p001:m0016" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AA">高祖</persName>策。</p>
</text>
